+    optimizing, since that is how they are compared when interpolated at
+    render time; the returned deltas are therefore integers too.
+
     Returns delta vector that has most number of None items instead of
     the input delta.
     """
 
+    deltas = _round_points(deltas)
+    coords = _round_points(coords)
+
